Subject: [PATCH 501/505] Track attention scales across V2 request slots and
 graph variants

Upstream base: spark-ds41f-1126 vLLM d8784b841c360f523ec20e44bf8fb0898f36d3e4.

Map the final query offsets into target rows. Keep GLP state separate. Capture distinct stock and active graphs, zero padding, and retain stock routing for dummy batches. Covered by the steering rows, state and consume suites.

Upstream status: downstream integration.
